      "body": "## Summary\n- Fix Issue #46348: deepseek-recipe rendering differs from the checkpoint's encoding.py\n- Add `namespace` field to `Function` class to support tool namespaces as expected by deepseek-recipe package (prevents \"Tool names must be unique\" errors when identical tool names exist in different namespaces)\n- Add `action` field to `ChatCompletionMessageGenericParam` and `ChatMessage` to support action tags in assistant messages\n- Update `Function._serialize` to preserve namespace field when set\n- Update `ChatMessage._serialize` to preserve action field when set\n- The `reasoning_content` field was already supported in the protocol and is preserved through the pipeline\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Verify that tools with namespaces are rendered correctly by deepseek-recipe\n- [ ] Verify that assistant messages with action fields are formatted as action tags\n- [ ] Verify that assistant messages with reasoning_content preserve it before tool results\n- [ ] Run existing deepseek-recipe tests to ensure no regressions\n- [ ] Test with the checkpoint's encoding.py to verify token-level match\n\nFixes #46348\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #40164693265](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40164693265)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #40164693323](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40164693323)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #40164693236](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40164693236)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
